Cell["\<\
So now, 
\[Phi]vals[[1]] ~ 13.68
Nvals[[1]] ~ 0

\[Phi]vals[[-1]] = 19.5
Nvals[[-1]] ~ 59-ish


We can also checl to make sure we are getting the valyes for epsilon at that \
\[Phi]=19.5 that they were getting!\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990021651639781*^9, 3.990021661636842*^9}, {
  3.990021700728953*^9, 
