Cell["\<\
Above was as a function of N, let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s put it in the form of \
\[CurlyEpsilon](\[Phi]):\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.964612636846953*^9, 3.964612687899805*^9}, 
   3.964614130719102*^9, {3.9646142824244223`*^9, 
