Cell["\<\
As you can see the symbolic form of \[CurlyEpsilon] matches well at high \
field values but they have a discrepancy the more the field rolls down as \
\[Phi] \[Rule] 0.

We should now consider looking at the higher order parameters to see how they \
differ from one another.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9641857602529593`*^9, 3.964185879642209*^9}, {
  3.96418597797501*^9, 3.964186193114822*^9}, {3.964276800444422*^9, 
  3.964276845690995*^9}, {3.964618068965464*^9, 
  3.9646181020412483`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6de22db2-016d-446b-b908-\
4ace04c63f6c"]
}, Open  ]],

